      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Re-check the issue while you work",
      "prov:value": "Measured here: a session missed **five** owner comments across eighty-four\nminutes while working — including the one asking for this rule — and found them\nonly when the author typed *\"new comments\"*. Every one of the five changed\ndirection or added scope."
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/issue-working.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "issue",
      "cat-harness:section": "Milestones and decision points go on the issue, as they happen",
      "prov:value": "Measured on issue #2302 (2026-10-06):\nthe owner asked for an issue update three times in one session — after the\nmethod comparison, after the figures work, and again for overall status —\neach time because the last one was hours and several milestones old.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "#2302",
