    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/issue-working.md#provenance-4",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Before you publish that something does not exist (STRICT)",
      "prov:value": "Both failures happened in one session on\n2026-09-21, one of them in a comment accusing a bean of exactly this error:\n[`bean-coordination`](../../../work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md) §\"Re-derive from the REMOTE\" has\nthe measurements and the two guards.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-21"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-21"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/issue-working.md#provenance-5",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "When the work has a BEAN and no issue (STRICT)",
      "prov:value": "**Measured 2026-09-20, bean `oh78`.** 54 proposals merged in one four-hour\nwindow and **2 issues changed**, both newly opened. Most of that day's work was\nbean-driven with no issue at all, so the rule above was not broken — it was\n*silently inapplicable*, which is worse, because a rule that quietly does not\napply reads from the outside exactly like a rule being followed.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean oh78",
        "2026-09-20"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/issue-working.md#provenance-6",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "When the work has a BEAN and no issue (STRICT)",
      "prov:value": "**And a bean that has an issue carries the link BOTH ways. Issue #558\n(*\"Sticky pin: unpinning loses the theme\"*) has no bean link although bean\n`ivfw` is its subject verbatim; issue #464 is open on a completed bean\n(`mggs`). One direction is not enough: a reader arriving at either object has\nto be able to reach the other, and a check reports the ones that cannot.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean ivfw",
        "#558",
        "#464"
      ]
    }
  ]
